This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.

Summary:
1. Primary Request and Intent:
   The user is implementing an iPad two-pane layout for the "Cloak & Dagger" React Native 0.80.1 app. The core design: a permanent 440px room-list sidebar overlaid on the left of the screen, with the existing stack navigator content shifted 440px to the right. Key requirements implemented:
   - Keep existing stack navigation unchanged
   - Sidebar slides in with animation after splash completes
   - Content margin animates from 0→440 simultaneously
   - Sidebar and margin hidden during: splash, welcome/login screens, fullscreen screens (verifyUser, setupScreenLock, etc.)
   - On sign-out: sidebar disappears immediately
   - `useNavigateToCorrectScreenHelper` updated with iPad-specific home navigation
   - **Current pending task**: Add `IpadScreenWrapper` to all non-modal, non-home, non-room screens (reference: `RoomDetails.tsx`)

2. Key Technical Concepts:
   - React Navigation stack navigator, `NavigationContainerRef.addListener("state", ...)` for route tracking outside navigators
   - Jotai atoms (default store, `getDefaultStore()`, `MatrixJotaiStore`) for state management
   - `@prototyp/skeletor` animation system: `useAnimateParallel` (hook, used in IpadSidebar) and `animateParallel` (non-hook, used in IpadLayoutWrapper) with `.start()` / `.reverse()` / `animations` prop on `Block`
   - `isIpad()` = `Platform.OS === "ios" && Platform.isPad`
   - `IpadScreenWrapper` component: on iPad wraps content in `Block flex={1} width="100%" maxWidth={680} margins={{ marginHorizontal: "auto" }}`, on phone renders children directly (or with passed props)
   - `effectiveWindowWidth()` updated from `width / 2` to `width - 440`
   - `splashFinished` atom gating sidebar visibility
   - `NavigationAtoms.splashFinished` reset in `AuthService.logout()`

3. Files and Code Sections:

   - **`src/screens/home/fragments/ipad-layout-wrapper/IpadLayoutWrapper.tsx`** (created)
     - Core wrapper component; handles `showSidebar` logic and margin animation
     - Reads `splashFinished`, `matrixClient`, and current route from `NavigationContainerRef`
     ```tsx
     import { animateParallel, Block } from "@prototyp/skeletor";
     import { useAtomValue } from "jotai";
     import { MatrixAtoms } from "modules/matrix-client/jotai";
     import { NavigationContainerRef } from "modules/navigation/const";
     import { NavigationAtoms } from "modules/navigation/jotai";
     import { type PropsWithChildren, useEffect, useRef, useState } from "react";
     import { Easing } from "react-native";
     import { isIpad } from "shared/utils";
     import { IpadSidebar } from "../ipad-sidebar";

     const SIDEBAR_WIDTH = 440;

     const FULLSCREEN_ROUTES: (keyof Routes)[] = [
       "splash", "welcome", "login", "onboarding", "notificationsIntro",
       "serverSelect", "confirmIdentity", "cantConfirm", "verifyUser",
       "verifyPin", "setupScreenLock", "enterRecoveryKey", "deactivateAccount", "oidcResetWebView",
     ];

     export const IpadLayoutWrapper: React.FC<PropsWithChildren> = ({ children }) => {
       const ipad = isIpad();
       const splashFinished = useAtomValue(NavigationAtoms.splashFinished);
       const matrixClient = useAtomValue(MatrixAtoms.matrixClient);
       const [currentRoute, setCurrentRoute] = useState<string | undefined>();

       useEffect(() => {
         return NavigationContainerRef?.addListener("state", () => {
           setCurrentRoute(NavigationContainerRef?.getCurrentRoute()?.name);
         });
       }, []);

       const showSidebar =
         ipad && splashFinished && matrixClient !== null &&
         !FULLSCREEN_ROUTES.includes(currentRoute as keyof Routes);

       const transition = useRef(
         animateParallel(
           { marginLeft: [0, SIDEBAR_WIDTH] },
           { duration: 350, easing: Easing.out(Easing.cubic), native: false },
         ),
       ).current;

       useEffect(() => {
         if (showSidebar) {
           setTimeout(() => transition.start(), 200);
         } else transition.reverse();
       }, [showSidebar]);

       return (
         <Block flex={1}>
           <Block flex={1} animations={transition.animations}>
             {children}
           </Block>
           {showSidebar && <IpadSidebar />}
         </Block>
       );
     };
     ```

   - **`src/screens/home/fragments/ipad-sidebar/IpadSidebar.tsx`** (created, then user-linter modified)
     - Absolute-positioned sidebar with rooms list; animates itself on mount
     ```tsx
     import { Block, useAnimateParallel } from "@prototyp/skeletor";
     import { DebugHelpers } from "modules/matrix-client/helpers";
     import { useEffect, useState } from "react";
     import { Easing, StyleSheet } from "react-native";
     import { useSafeAreaInsets } from "react-native-safe-area-context";
